Credits and notices
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

DATUM. Forge Solo's TIDES mode, and the gateway program built from this
repository, follow DATUM (Decentralized Alternative Templates for Universal
Mining), designed and built by OCEAN:

    https://ocean.xyz/docs/datum
    https://github.com/OCEAN-xyz/datum_gateway

The DATUM Gateway is Copyright (c) 2024-2025 Bitcoin Ocean, LLC, Jason Hughes,
and individual contributors, and is released under the MIT License. The idea
this software follows is theirs: every miner's own node builds the block
template, and each block's coinbase pays the pool's miners directly, so the
pool never holds the reward. This software is an independent implementation,
written in Go for Bitcoin Cash II and Forge Pool. It is not derived from the
DATUM Gateway's source code, and it does not speak OCEAN's DATUM Protocol.

TIDES. The payout split these gateways write into every coinbase follows
TIDES, OCEAN's reward system: https://ocean.xyz/docs/tides

Not affiliated. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored
by OCEAN, Bitcoin Ocean, LLC, or Mummolin, Inc. The names DATUM, TIDES and
OCEAN appear here only to credit and describe the designs this software
follows; any trademarks in them belong to their owners, and OCEAN's copyright
license grants no right to use them.
